& [Profiles]
  + request commission-envelope mutation-fence-plan capability-account admission-receipt evidence-manifest and artifact-identity profiles begin at revision 0.1
  + imported B0 formation record and Rev0.4 provider-only simulation receipt retain their exact existing profiles and raw identities

& [CommissionEnvelope]
  + identities are commission correlation attempt issuer subject recovery owner stage operator-authorization artifact carrier implementation bookend expected-current branch scratch role paths and plan digest
  + maximum_attempts one retry_count zero and exact one-stage scope are explicit non-normalized fields
  + commission self-digest is domain-separated and excludes only its own digest field

& [CapabilityAccount]
  + requested future grants are seven exact B0 variants in declaration order and denials are the remaining fifteen in declaration order
  + account binds expected granted count denied count unique count overlap count and one domain-separated digest
  + pure receipt does not issue or authenticate any capability

& [MutationFencePlan]
  + exact nine-step sequence binds validation lease second observation setup execution retained verification outcome publication consumption and release
  + lease coordinate derivation ledger coordinate derivation hold interval no-wait single-use no-retry no-cleanup and retained-uncertainty rules are explicit
  + physical lease and ledger booleans remain false in pure evidence

& [AdmissionReceipt]
  + receipt binds raw upstream artifact digests request commission fence capability and unresolved digests plus zero-effect consequence account
  + status is commission_shape_admitted_production_broker_not_run authority is commission_admission_only physical_contact false and every runtime truth remains false
  + receipt self-digest is domain-separated and deterministic

& [Bounds]
  + maximum JSON depth 32 fields 256 artifacts 16 one artifact bytes 16777216 total evidence bytes 67108864 machine-form bytes 2097152 paths 16 fence steps 9 and capabilities 22
  + artifact paths are portable relative simple evidence coordinates with no rooted path or parent traversal
